Spec: "useJudgeShortcuts() window keydown listener". So no args; internally creates dispatcher via useJudgeDispatcher(). But App also needs dispatch for JudgeBar's onAction → App calls both useJudgeDispatcher() and useJudgeShortcuts(). If useJudgeShortcuts creates its own dispatcher, two dispatcher instances (both stateless, fine).

